{
    "id":  26707,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "Pack of 6 LED Panels 120x30cm 40W 4000 lm with Philips CertaDrive | 5 -Year Warranty",
    "reference":  "PNPHL40W120-CW-91145",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePack of 6 LED Panels 120x30 cm 40W\u003c/strong\u003e with SMD2835 technology, 110 lm/W and a \u003cstrong\u003ePhilips CertaDrive, \u003c/strong\u003edesigned to deliver uniform, high-efficiency lighting. Backlight technology,\u003cstrong\u003e available in 4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e, with No Flicker operation for greater visual comfort. Made of steel with a slim, professional design, they \u003cstrong\u003einclude ENEC05, CE and TÜV certification and a 5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e. Ideal for offices, shops and professional LED lighting projects. Sold in full boxes of 6\u0026nbsp;units.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003e\nLED Panel 120x30 40W Philips CertaDrive\u0026nbsp;| 5-Year Warranty\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePack of 6 LED Panels 120x30 cm 40W 4000Lm\u003c/strong\u003e is a professional \u003cstrong\u003eLED ceiling lighting\u003c/strong\u003e solution designed to deliver uniform, efficient and comfortable lighting in commercial and professional projects. It features \u003cstrong\u003eSMD2835 technology with an efficiency of 110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003ePhilips CertaDrive\u003c/strong\u003e, ensuring stable and reliable operation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eBacklight\u003c/strong\u003e technology provides an even light distribution, reducing dark areas and delivering a uniform luminous finish across the entire panel surface. It is also available in \u003cstrong\u003e4000K and 5700K\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing you to choose between neutral or cool lighting according to the needs of each space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eEfficient technology and visual comfort\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eEach panel offers a power of \u003cstrong\u003e40W\u003c/strong\u003e and a performance of \u003cstrong\u003e110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, providing a good balance between energy consumption and lighting level. The \u003cstrong\u003eNo Flicker\u003c/strong\u003e operation prevents perceptible flickering, improving visual comfort and making these panels especially suitable for spaces where people stay for long periods.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003ePhilips CertaDrive\u003c/strong\u003e brings stability and reliability to the assembly, while the \u003cstrong\u003esteel\u003c/strong\u003e construction provides strength and durability. Its slim, professional design makes it easy to integrate into different indoor lighting solutions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eReliability for professional projects\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe panels carry \u003cstrong\u003eENEC05, CE and TÜV certification\u003c/strong\u003e and offer a \u003cstrong\u003e5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e, providing safety and confidence for professional installations. The \u003cstrong\u003e120x30 cm\u003c/strong\u003e format covers large surfaces efficiently, reducing the number of luminaires required and simplifying project planning.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe product is supplied in a \u003cstrong\u003epack of 6 units\u003c/strong\u003e, while \u003cstrong\u003esales are made in full boxes of 6\u0026nbsp;units\u003c/strong\u003e, a format that is especially attractive for installers, distributors and volume projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOffices and workspaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail outlets\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEducational centres\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHotels and professional spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShopping centres\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMeeting rooms\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePremises and establishments\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional LED lighting projects\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003ePack of 6 LED Panels 120x30 40W with Philips CertaDrive\u003c/strong\u003e combines \u003cstrong\u003eBacklight technology, 110 lm/W, No Flicker operation, ENEC05, CE and TÜV certification and a 5-year warranty\u003c/strong\u003e in an efficient and long-lasting solution. A safe choice for reducing energy consumption, improving visual comfort and achieving an excellent \u003cstrong\u003ereturn on investment (ROI)\u003c/strong\u003e in professional lighting projects.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
